# Data and outputs live on OSF (https://osf.io/5zjae/), not in git.
# The only tracked files under these folders are the ones Plot Figures.ipynb needs, which were
# added with `git add -f` (git keeps tracking a file once it is added, even if it matches here):
#   analysis/participants*.tsv, analysis/parcels, analysis/FeatureSpaceCorrelation (chunk-120 pairs),
#   analysis/PCInterpretation/compiled_pooled_results.csv, the subfigures used to assemble the
#   paper figures, the final figures in figures/main and figures/supplemental, and the
#   supplementary tables in tables/ (see the README).
# To track a new file in one of these folders, use `git add -f <file>`.
analysis/
features/
figures/
tables/
paper/
